msgctxt "152"
msgid "Listen to the whole thing, dammit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Just let me finish..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Wait till the end..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Oh, for crying out loud..."
msgstr "...Oh, al diavolo."

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"Now that you caused all this havoc, I'm gonna have to do something about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "272"
msgid "You're looking for the Reapers, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "296"
msgid "I'm in the information business these days. I got bored of fighting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"If you sit here long enough, you'll know all the things that are going on in"
" Kamurocho. It's the perfect observation point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "But thanks to you, I can't afford to be singing here anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "That was my last street performance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Time to turn back into the hitman Shinzaki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "So you were Shinzaki all along..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "I know you're here to catch me, but you don't stand a chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"I'm the boss's trump card. When he sends me out, it means he's royally "
"pissed off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "We'll kill you soon enough. Until then, enjoy your life while you can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "You're running away?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"Naturally. Now that we're seriously short on men, thanks to you, I've got a "
"ton of work to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "I'm not letting you get away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Then try and catch me. If you think you can keep up, that is."
msgstr ""

